This directory holds the link-time artifacts (.dll / .lib / .pdb) that
the App / Tests vcxprojs link against via $(ProjectDir)..\ghostty as
their AdditionalLibraryDirectories. Those files are produced from the
ghostty submodule at external/ghostty/ during build (see README's
"Build from Source" section, and .github/actions/build-signed-msix/
action.yml in CI).

The artifacts themselves are .gitignored. This .gitkeep is here so
git preserves the empty directory at checkout time — the build /
CI scripts assume the directory already exists when they Copy-Item
the freshly-built dll / lib / pdb into it.
